{"2492330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bronana", "steam_appid": 2492330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras/d8ad740e0761ac2bdd9c1e96eccf8893.avif?t=1737784984\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras_big/d8ad740e0761ac2bdd9c1e96eccf8893.avif?t=1737784984 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras/5db74bc8f81646581ff264c8ba6e1159.avif?t=1737784984\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras_big/5db74bc8f81646581ff264c8ba6e1159.avif?t=1737784984 width=800 height=342 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras/3c9bb5c78accc492c8a5439fa620f96d.avif?t=1737784984\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras_big/3c9bb5c78accc492c8a5439fa620f96d.avif?t=1737784984 width=800 height=472 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras/dfe424851e5a31bd306a80108bfea546.avif?t=1737784984\" width=662 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bronana</i> is a survivor-like game where you play as a Banana Warrior, battling the mutant minions of the food processing plant. In each stage, collect resources and spend them and power up during brief intermissions. Customize your playstyle, achieve explosive power-ups, and grow stronger to face off against progressively tougher enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras/82a40a54244f1578cad77b6448eb6c2a.poster.avif?t=1737784984\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras/82a40a54244f1578cad77b6448eb6c2a.webm?t=1737784984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras/82a40a54244f1578cad77b6448eb6c2a.mp4?t=1737784984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tranquil forest is suddenly invaded by cruel enforcers from the food processing plant. They’ve captured your siblings and plan on turning them into canned fruit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To restore peace, the Banana Warriors — guardians of the fruit family  take up arms to battle the evil forces of the food processing plant, determined to make those who harm their kin pay the ultimate price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras/011d6fcd34cc24b08ad300dc24058e93.poster.avif?t=1737784984\" width=598 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras/011d6fcd34cc24b08ad300dc24058e93.webm?t=1737784984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras/011d6fcd34cc24b08ad300dc24058e93.mp4?t=1737784984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transformed into sinister snacks, these once-edible foods have been infused with an evil will and are hell bent on destroying you. Don’t hold back — use every skill at your disposal to fight mercilessley and make bananas their worst nightmare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras/9ece2d8ecaee6287e257105b0613ec9f.avif?t=1737784984\" width=662 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivor-Like Gameplay - </strong>Inspired by Vampire Survivors, the game blends random events and choice-based paths, delivering a unique growth curve.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quirky and Humorous Visuals - </strong>Experience the charm of adorable banana characters, food-shaped monsters, and bosses with comical expressions and animations. It’s more about fun and laughter than just dodging and shooting.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Class Experiences - </strong>Pick a dashing fighter or a powerhouse Banana Warrior! A variety of classes ensure there’s something for everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random NPC Events - </strong>Unpredictability is the core of Bronana. Brace yourself for unexpected penalties, but don’t despair — some NPC rewards are so good, they’ll have you screaming with joy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Build Customization - </strong>Mix and match your Banana Warrior with 35+ weapons and 240+ accessories to create a custom build tailored to your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Replayability - </strong>Packed with content and a customizable difficulty system, the full version of Bronana promises at least 60+ hours of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hilarious Boss Battles - </strong>Our boss fights are tough—so tough, it’s hard not to laugh! Every boss battle is packed with quirky traits and internet memes.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras/3c9bb5c78accc492c8a5439fa620f96d.avif?t=1737784984\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras_big/3c9bb5c78accc492c8a5439fa620f96d.avif?t=1737784984 width=800 height=472 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras/dfe424851e5a31bd306a80108bfea546.avif?t=1737784984\" width=662 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bronana</i> is a survivor-like game where you play as a Banana Warrior, battling the mutant minions of the food processing plant. In each stage, collect resources and spend them and power up during brief intermissions. Customize your playstyle, achieve explosive power-ups, and grow stronger to face off against progressively tougher enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras/82a40a54244f1578cad77b6448eb6c2a.poster.avif?t=1737784984\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras/82a40a54244f1578cad77b6448eb6c2a.webm?t=1737784984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras/82a40a54244f1578cad77b6448eb6c2a.mp4?t=1737784984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tranquil forest is suddenly invaded by cruel enforcers from the food processing plant. They’ve captured your siblings and plan on turning them into canned fruit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To restore peace, the Banana Warriors — guardians of the fruit family  take up arms to battle the evil forces of the food processing plant, determined to make those who harm their kin pay the ultimate price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras/011d6fcd34cc24b08ad300dc24058e93.poster.avif?t=1737784984\" width=598 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras/011d6fcd34cc24b08ad300dc24058e93.webm?t=1737784984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras/011d6fcd34cc24b08ad300dc24058e93.mp4?t=1737784984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transformed into sinister snacks, these once-edible foods have been infused with an evil will and are hell bent on destroying you. Don’t hold back — use every skill at your disposal to fight mercilessley and make bananas their worst nightmare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492330/extras/9ece2d8ecaee6287e257105b0613ec9f.avif?t=1737784984\" width=662 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivor-Like Gameplay - </strong>Inspired by Vampire Survivors, the game blends random events and choice-based paths, delivering a unique growth curve.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quirky and Humorous Visuals - </strong>Experience the charm of adorable banana characters, food-shaped monsters, and bosses with comical expressions and animations. It’s more about fun and laughter than just dodging and shooting.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Class Experiences - </strong>Pick a dashing fighter or a powerhouse Banana Warrior! A variety of classes ensure there’s something for everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random NPC Events - </strong>Unpredictability is the core of Bronana. Brace yourself for unexpected penalties, but don’t despair — some NPC rewards are so good, they’ll have you screaming with joy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Build Customization - </strong>Mix and match your Banana Warrior with 35+ weapons and 240+ accessories to create a custom build tailored to your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Replayability - </strong>Packed with content and a customizable difficulty system, the full version of Bronana promises at least 60+ hours of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hilarious Boss Battles - </strong>Our boss fights are tough—so tough, it’s hard not to laugh! Every boss battle is packed with quirky traits and internet memes.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Bronana is a thrilling and hilarious survival roguelike. Embody the spirit of a fearless banana warrior to take down waves of vicious snack monsters. Through a rich variety of random events, grow stronger, evolve abilities, and face off against challenging bosses to save the homeland.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“&quot;Bronana&quot; brings an innovative twist through its random events and distinctive class-exclusive items, making its progression system a true standout in the genre.”<br />\r\n8.2 – 游戏酒馆<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“&quot;The boss designs are complete with hilarious details—you can even see a hamburger turn into Iron Man in the game!&quot;”<br />\r\n7.9 – 黑核